{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_hmau_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_hmau_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "南牆",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_hmau_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a438574eda5852eb7122f37c6ffd8987fdb5701fc075d2c39a67fdd10370d543",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_021",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早啊，吽，今天怎麼沒去上班啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，出了些事情，就不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_021",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你生病了？哎呀，還不趕緊回家歇著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是不是，沒有的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_021",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哎，別走啊，你那新工作怎麼樣啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）快閉嘴吧，這小子一臉苦相一看就是又被開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_021",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）又？這都第幾次了......唉，這是厚道人啊，就是不會變通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_021",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）這年頭啊，還是機靈點的人吃得開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_032",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）可不是，這世道千變萬變的，人啊，不跟著變，就廢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大少爺，來的時候我怎麼和你講的，閒事少管！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是不是以前屁股坐得太高，腦袋在上面缺氧轉不過來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在龍門這個地方，做生意就是得靈活！靈活！懂嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了走這批貨，我走了多少門路？托了多少關係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你倒好，一句來路不明就捅了出去！大少爺，你可真是正義凜然啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆......這批東西它很危險，一旦賣給黑幫，後果不堪——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我管那些！真金白銀我不管，我管那些！我呸，你算什麼東西，來教我做事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是什麼？沒有可是，你趕緊給我滾，我再也不想看到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對、對不起，老闆，我就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滾滾滾！你和你老爹就是一路貨色，你活該，你老爹破產也是他活該！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆，你怎麼能這麼說，這事扯不上我爸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前老闆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快滾啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（咕嚕嚕——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（唉......先去吃點東西吧。吃完試著再找份其他的活兒幹吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街邊廣告",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "靚仔靚女走過路過不要錯過，小店新開業八折優惠，正宗尚蜀風味小麵歡迎大家來品嘗。靚仔靚女走過路過不要錯過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（摸摸口袋裡的錢包）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "應該還夠，去吃一碗吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歡迎光臨，靚仔你想吃點什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆，我、我先看看菜單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那來一碗我們店的招牌“麵麵俱到”如何，裡面什麼葷素澆頭都有，味道很正的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你，老闆，我光來碗素麵就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "光一碗素麵？飲料不要？小菜不要？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要了，老闆，一碗素麵就夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（撇撇嘴）嘖，行吧，拿號過去排著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆，來碗小麵，第一次來有什麼推薦的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那肯定是本店的特色“麵麵俱到”了，吃過的人都誇好味道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行，就它了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，客人您真是爽快，這是您的號，一會兒就給您送過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝了老闆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，小兄弟，你來吃過這家嗎？味道如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有，我也是第一次來，不知道是什麼味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那以前吃過尚蜀菜嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小時候和家父在大酒樓吃過，好吃，我很喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，不過大酒樓有時候可不比小館子啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，客人，您的麵來了，好吃不好吃，吃完您都給提提意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，好好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆，那我的素麵什麼時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呦，我說你急什麼，煮麵不要花時間的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是這位先生的麵都好了，我的應該也好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，你這人很奇怪啊，你們要的又不是一種麵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在的人愈發沒耐心了，美食啊，是要等的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯咳，老闆，你這店新開業難道不忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？對對對，忙、是忙，客人您慢用，我先忙去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（點頭致謝）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，客氣客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（算了，再等等吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（這店裡裝修很別緻，原來這就是尚蜀風格啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小時候老爸總說要帶我去尚蜀吃最正宗的尚蜀美食......唉，他都不在了，想這些有什麼用。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嗯，那個人左顧右盼地想幹什麼呢？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（紙包，他懷裡揣著個紙包做什麼......等等，他是不是把什麼東西丟進碗裡去了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這位先生，你這是在做什——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，老闆，給老子過來！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來了來了，客人您什麼事找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這老闆幹什麼吃的，你這麵裡面有蟲子！喏，看見沒，黑黑亮亮的，好大一隻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "客人，這不可能的，您看我這告示欄，衛生水準是最高級別，絕對不可能出這樣的差錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你少放屁，證據就漂在碗裡，你還抵賴不成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抵賴？我看不是我要抵賴，是你要碰瓷吧！我這店裡可是有監控的，誰的過錯到時候一目了然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（掀桌子）看個屁的監控啊！找打是不是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩人正你一嘴我一嘴地吵著，誰都沒注意到那碗滾燙的湯麵隨著被掀翻的桌子彈起，朝著正吃麵的老鯉騰空飛去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（唉，不急，等吃完這口也不是躲不開。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶哈，好燙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這位先生，您沒事吧？有沒有被潑到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，無妨無妨，反倒是小兄弟你被這熱麵湯澆了一頭一臉，恐怕不好受啊。給，這手帕你先拿去擦擦臉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（唉，這人情算是欠下了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "抖落盡臉上的麵條菜葉，吽將老鯉遞過來的帕子罩在臉上，低頭胡亂擦拭了一通。\n然後他捏著那塊被麵湯浸濕的布，一時也不知是該還不該還。正打算抬眼問問老鯉，便看見老鯉一直指著自己的腦袋頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那裡、那裡還有點東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聞言，吽抓了抓頭頂的絨毛，從裡面捉出一個脆硬的物事，攤開手來一看，一隻油亮的大黑蟲窩在掌心裡面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還多嘴，你是不是找打？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你動手動腳的幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可沒心思再和你耍嘴皮子了，照我看啊，拳頭在你這兒管用多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，這麵不算您的錢了還不行嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想得美，鬧到這個地步，我豈是一碗麵錢就能打發得了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那您——先鬆手，我、我快上不來氣了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽到了嗎？鬆開他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你哪位啊？吃你的飯去，少來管閒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你沒聽到嗎？這位老闆說，鬆、開、他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "狗東西，我看你也是找打！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大哥，嗚嗚嗚，大哥，對不起，我錯了，饒小弟一命吧，再也不敢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你別哭了好嗎？搞得好像是我在欺負你一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（唉，剛剛氣急手腳重了些，這人應該不會有事吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這傷，要緊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哎呦，他哪來的好心還問我傷勢，不會是在試探我會不會碰他瓷吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......不要緊吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要緊，我的傷不要緊，都、都是小弟我自己不小心撞的，和您沒有關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，撞的？難道不是我剛剛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有沒有，大哥多慮了，都是小弟我不長眼睛，是我活該，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "混混",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大哥，我、我還有事，先告辭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，你這一瘸一拐的......走慢點啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呦，這位小哥，真是感激不盡啊，多虧了你趕走這潑皮啊，我們小本生意啊，折騰不得哪，哎呦呦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆，剛剛那人出手沒傷到你吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多謝小哥您及時相助，他連我一塊皮都沒蹭到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（咕嚕嚕——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆，那個......我的麵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看我這記性，您坐一會兒，馬上就給您端過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小兄弟，方才真是謝謝你了，免了我穿一身髒衣服回家，被家裡的小丫頭一頓念叨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，您家裡是有個女兒嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是......唉，也算是我女兒吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，這是也不是的怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難說清，說不清......對了，小兄弟，我看你身手不錯，是師從何處啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您過獎了，只是從家父那裡學了些粗淺功夫，不足掛齒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得幾年前龍門有家保全公司的老闆也使這手擒拿功夫，姓什麼來著......看我這腦子，一時半會兒也想不起了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姓高，正是家父。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，是他啊，令尊可還好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去年年末......故去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "節哀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都是過去的事，謝謝您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小哥，您的麵來了，清湯寡水的，我給您加了幾勺葷的澆頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這......謝謝老闆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（掰開筷子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小哥啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（放下筷子）老闆，您是還有話要說嗎？直說就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小哥，你也知道，這條街上租金高，生意不好做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，我清楚的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖說啊，您趕走那無賴是幫了我大忙，可您剛剛行如電步如風的，可損壞了店裡不少物件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們啊，還是得各算各的，您幫了我是一碼事，這碗麵我就請您吃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另一碼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這壞了的東西，您看看，怎麼賠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（握緊拳頭）老闆，我剛剛是為了幫你才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呦，你捏起個拳頭幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要打人啊？那我看你和那無賴也沒有什麼差別嘛，仗著自己拳腳功夫好就胡作非為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是......我沒那個意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就賠錢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆，你不能這樣咄咄逼人，這樣不行......不好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼好不好，行不行，損壞別人財物照價賠償，這是天經，這是地義，這是公理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸，今天怎麼樣了？唉，你怎麼又只吃了兩口，這樣身體怎麼撐得住？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，你可別念叨我了，隔壁床天天笑我，說我這兒子比他家小棉襖還貼心，咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這肺管子就別跟著笑了吧，爸你還有什麼想吃的嗎？再給你削個蘋果吃？晚上肚子裡不墊點東西不好睡覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久沒吃蛋炒飯，有些饞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恐怕不好吧，你吃了不消化半夜又要難受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你又開始念叨了不是，我就是說說，得得得，幫我削個蘋果吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......最近工作怎麼樣啊，老李他是不是說你了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸，沒有的事，李伯伯挺好的，說我幹活認真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你小子矇誰呢，看你這愁眉苦臉的，准是挨批評了，爸爸面前你還裝什麼，照實說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近遇上了件事，和李伯伯有些分歧。只是為了些蠅頭小利，李伯伯竟然那樣對待自己的客戶，實在是不講道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，你啊，和我一樣，認死理。我吃大虧也就算了，你可千萬別再學我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸你怎麼這麼說，不是你從小教我是非對錯自己心裡得有數嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我這輩子就是太有數了才落到這個地步！可你呢，二十歲出頭，正是好光好景的時候，何苦像我一樣碰得一身傷滿頭包的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸！瞎說什麼呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "病重的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希聲啊，聽爸爸的，有時候就認了吧，不要拿腦袋去撞了，最後頭破血流的，不好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，小哥，這時候您怎麼還發上呆了。一共一萬五，您看什麼時候結？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（鬆開拳頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......老闆，我身上錢不剩幾個，能不能留在店裡做幫工來還？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，也成，我撿一個打白工的也不虧，看你這膀子力氣，洗碗肯定乾淨。先說好，我可不包你吃住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆啊，我麵吃完了，錢放在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，客人您慢走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，老闆，您不是說要我給提提意見嗎？我啊，剛剛發現了一個大問題得和您說說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "客人，我這正談事情呢，怕是不方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不著急，我可以等等，就是不知道你能不能等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您這......那我可得仔細聽聽客人您的高見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛剛坐下吃飯的時候，我數了數你這消防設施的數量，數了三遍，將將三個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我沒記錯的話，上個月出台的消防法規好像規定了，這麼大的店面，裡面的消防設施應該不少於六個，少一個，罰五千。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我算算，一共是......啊，正好一萬五。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，最近消防局查得嚴啊，一個投訴電話打過去，立馬就要飛奔著趕來了，不知道老闆您有沒有時間去搞這少了的三個設施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，不好辦啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "客人，話都說到這份兒上了，就不要藏著掖著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您新店開業這麼忙，有些事能放過就放過吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說呢，原來是打算上我這充菩薩來了。我奉勸你，少管閒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，該管還是要管一管的，我身為龍門市民，總該對本市消防安全有些責任感嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶——你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麵館老闆",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呸，算我倒楣！傻大個，既然有人給你出頭了，還杵著幹什麼？還不快滾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小兄弟，既然老闆都這麼說了，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，方才謝謝您替我解圍，我沒什麼可以報答您，您要是有什麼力氣活，盡可以差遣我去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，不必了，我不過是費了些嘴皮子功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生留步！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小兄弟你當真不必再謝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是、不是這個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，你還有其他話要說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生您，能不能......能不能教教我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "教你？小兄弟說笑話了，我又有什麼可以教你的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，從前、從前我深信世上是非對錯分明如觀火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可如今......想起遭遇過的事，反而覺得更像是牆上燈影，看不真切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍門這地方人太多，求財的，求義的，求生的，求樂子的，求光鮮的，求真相的，全都匯在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡有千千萬萬個人，長了千千萬萬張嘴，而這千千萬萬張嘴又說了千千萬萬個道理，各個都不相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別人那裡，自己堅持的道理不是道理，自己這裡，別人的道理又說不通，所以只好強按著別人的腦袋來認自己的理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那既然如此，公理在何處，道義又在何處呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生......把您會的都教給我吧，我不想撞得頭破血流，但我更不想低頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小兄弟，你歲數還小，困惑多些很正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你問的這些，我沒法教你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，也只是這千千萬萬人中的一個啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生，我......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（咕嚕嚕——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但或許，我可以教你些別的東西，比如炒一碗蛋炒飯，咸淡適宜，粒粒分明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，蛋炒飯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，怎樣，想學嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "speakerToken": "avg_226_hmau_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......謝謝先生願意賜教。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_322_lmlee_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，那就快走吧，這個時候去市場，還買得到新鮮的小蔥和蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
